            <ArticleTitle>Shigella flexneri bacteremia in a child.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>403-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report an unusual and lethal case of Shigella flexneri septicemia in an 8-year-old Saudi handicapped child from a social home presenting with severe toxic megacolon and acute abdomen secondary to fulminant necrotizing enterocolitis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
